{"step_index":3626,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T19:31:34Z","thinking":"Calculating the total shortages involves summing the matched items, items needing review, and items not found. This provides an overall quantity. Further, the number of unique shortages must also be determined for the summary.\n\n\nThe current calculation for total shortages is incorrect because it sums matched, not-found, and review items, resulting in an inaccurate representation of the raw data. The goal is to accurately show both the total raw shortage items and the de-duplicated count. Therefore, the total shortage count needs to be updated to reflect the actual raw rows, while the number of unique shortages must also be shown, and the pedantic packaging rules need updating in a configuration file.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":"false","Description":"\"Update packaging rule in SYSTEM_PROMPT to make standard packaging direct matches\"","EndLine":"45","Instruction":"\"Update Rule 3 in SYSTEM_PROMPT\"","ReplacementContent":"\"3. PACKAGING, PACK SIZE, TABLET COUNT & WHOLESALE UNITS (MATCH vs REVIEW):\\n   - \\\"match\\\": Exact same active drug brand, same strength, same dosage form.\\n     CRITICAL RULE (STANDARD PACKS): If the requested shortage specifies a pack count (e.g. \\\"ديجستين 20قرص\\\", \\\"كيتولاك 5 امبوله\\\", \\\"كولونا 3شريط\\\", \\\"تادانيرفي 20فيلم\\\", \\\"ايفاستين 2 شريط\\\") and the warehouse candidate has the same drug, form, and strength but does not explicitly state the pack size (e.g. \\\"ديجستين اقراص/فاركو\\\", \\\"كيتولاك امبول/العامريه\\\", \\\"كولونا اقراص ٦٢ج\\\", \\\"تادانيرفي ٥ مجم سعر جديد\\\"):\\n     THIS IS A 100% MATCH (\\\"status\\\": \\\"match\\\")! NEVER mark this as review!\\n     CRITICAL RULE: If the numbers/counts are identical (even if written in Arabic numerals ٣ vs 3) or the only difference is the manufacturer name (/نوفارتس, /اكاديميا, /ايبيكو), THIS IS A 100% MATCH. NEVER mark as review!\\n   - \\\"review\\\": ONLY mark review when there is an EXPLICIT, CONFLICTING number on BOTH sides (e.g. requested 15 tablets vs candidate explicitly writes 60 tablets, requested 24 tablets vs candidate explicitly writes 48 tablets).\\n     In this case, return \\\"status\\\": \\\"review\\\" AND provide a clear Arabic explanation in \\\"reason\\\" (e.g. \\\"اختلاف عدد الأقراص: المطلوب 15 قرص والمرشح 60 قرص\\\").\"","StartLine":"26","TargetContent":"\"3. PACKAGING, PACK SIZE, TABLET COUNT & WHOLESALE UNITS (MATCH vs REVIEW):\\n   - \\\"match\\\": Exact same active drug brand, same strength, same dosage form.\\n     If pack size/count is identical (e.g. \\\"فولتارين ٣ امبولات\\\" matching \\\"فولتارين ٣ امبولات/نوفارتس\\\", \\\"كونتافين ١ شريط\\\" matching \\\"كونتافين ١ شريط/اكاديميا\\\") OR not specified in the requested shortage (e.g. \\\"سيتال اقراص\\\" matching \\\"سيتال اقراص 20 قرص\\\", or \\\"كليكسان 40 حقن\\\" matching \\\"كليكسان 40مجم-84\\\"), return \\\"status\\\": \\\"match\\\".\\n     CRITICAL: If the numbers/counts are identical (even if written in Arabic numerals ٣ vs 3) or the only difference is the manufacturer name (/نوفارتس, /اكاديميا, /ايبيكو), THIS IS A 100% MATCH. NEVER mark as review!\\n   - \\\"review\\\": Same active drug brand, same strength, same dosage form, BUT different pack size, tablet count, or packaging variant (e.g. requested 15 tablets vs candidate 60 tablets, requested 24 tablets vs candidate 48 tablets, requested medium vs candidate large / باكو 25).\\n     In this case, return \\\"status\\\": \\\"review\\\" AND provide a clear Arabic explanation in \\\"reason\\\" (e.g. \\\"اختلاف عدد الأقراص: المطلوب 15 قرص والمرشح 60 قرص\\\" or \\\"اختلاف الحجم: المطلوب وسط والمرشح كبير باكو 25\\\").\"","TargetFile":"\"d:\\\\AI_Engineer\\\\Pharmacy-agy\\\\src\\\\fast_match\\\\coordinator.py\"","toolAction":"\"Update packaging rule\"","toolSummary":"\"Update Rule 3 to make standard packs direct match\""}}]}
