ate the pack size (e.g. \"ديجستين اقراص/فاركو\", \"كيتولاك امبول/العامريه\", \"كولونا اقراص ٦٢ج\", \"تادانيرفي ٥ مجم سعر جديد\"):\n+     THIS IS A 100% MATCH (\"status\": \"match\")! NEVER mark this as review!\n+     CRITICAL RULE: If the numbers/counts are identical (even if written in Arabic numerals ٣ vs 3) or the only difference is the manufacturer name (/نوفارتس, /اكاديميا, /ايبيكو), THIS IS A 100% MATCH. NEVER mark as review!\n+   - \"review\": ONLY mark review when there is an EXPLICIT, CONFLICTING number on BOTH sides (e.g. requested 15 tablets vs candidate explicitly writes 60 tablets, requested 24 tablets vs candidate explicitly writes 48 tablets).\n+     In this case, return \"status\": \"review\" AND provide a clear Arabic explanation in \"reason\" (e.g. \"اختلاف عدد الأقراص: المطلوب 15 قرص والمرشح 60 قرص\").\n \n 4. TRADE BRAND vs GENERIC / ALTERNATIVE (بديل أو مثيل):\n    - \"match\": Both items must have the SAME commercial trade brand name (e.g. Panadol matching Panadol, Zovirax matching Zovirax).\n[diff_block_end]\n\nPlease note that the above snippet only shows the MODIFIED lines from the last change. It shows up to 3 lines of unchanged lines before and after the modified lines. The actual file contents may have many more lines not shown."}
